            {"id":"ec3376fa-9","kind":"document-block","change":"removed","class":"documentation","bump":"patch","indirect":false,"contexts":[],"record":"color-area/documentBlocks/9","name":"guideline: When using color areas, it’s important to clearl","fields":[],"before":{"type":"guideline","content":"When using color areas, it’s important to clearly display the color selection in real time. This can be in a color swatch, directly on the canvas, or both."}},
